\f1\fs22 Gerry sat in an \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
ergonomic status-affirming leather chair, \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 on one side of the oval table that could seat twenty, and tried to make sense of the large art works on the beige wall opposite. The bleary lighting of the room didn\'92t help; it was meant to be calming, but it just made everything look as two-dimensional as the paintings.\
\pard\pardeftab720\fi360\sl220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
